sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Conn as ConnectionFlow
    participant Async as AsyncFiber / in-flight commands
    participant RB as ReplyBuilder
    Client->>Conn: 合法命令 A + 非法尾部
    Conn->>Async: A 可能已入队
    Conn->>Conn: parser_status = ERROR
    Conn->>Async: JoinIfNeeded / Drain queues
    Async-->>Conn: A 的回复已完成
    Conn->>RB: SendProtocolError
    RB-->>Client: A reply，随后 -ERR Protocol error
    Conn->>Client: shutdown(SHUT_WR)
    Client-->>Conn: 关闭或剩余输入
    Conn->>Conn: 丢弃输入直至 EOF
